		{
			dependencies: ["4665C4EBAF93553D"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#B57BE0 to=#E2C8F4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>女巫坩埚</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>炼药锅原本就能酿造的一切，</grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>无需八次右键点击，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>即可实现。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B57BE0 to=#E2C8F4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>底座为 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>桃花心木木板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，三乘三。其中五块是控制器及其端口。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>岩浆块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在基地中央，正下方是一个真实的 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>混合炼药锅</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。顶部角落是 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>白垩岩块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，边缘是 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>女巫榛木板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 岩浆就是你本应在下面点燃的火。需要热量的配方可以免费在这里获取。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#B57BE0 to=#E2C8F4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将材料放入 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边八个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>水或岩浆</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>倒入酿造港，共二十桶，分装于两个储罐中</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>每次合成消耗5000 FE，耗时2.5秒</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"液体未被消耗。它必须储存在储罐中，并且必须是正确的液体，仅此而已。将水和岩浆并排装载，反应釜会自动在两者之间切换。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#B57BE0 to=#E2C8F4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>扫帚</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三把扫帚是例外。它们会把水桶里的水变成 </grad><grad from=#C79BFF to=#7B3FD1 f=0.8>血</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并从酿造港的另一侧流出，所以得找个地方排走。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 三个配方仍使用真锅。Moon Dust需要满月，Ankh Amulet和Replacer Satchel用药水而非水酿造。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器以获取完整列表。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:coven_retort"
			id: "01D3A8218B8412B3"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "21CDFA7C7D1255F8"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "octagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "女巫的炖锅"
